# ─── MT-020 (2026-05-28): editor / AI-tool configurations ────────────────
# Each developer's tooling configuration leaks personal preferences and
# editor state into the repo. None of these belong in source control. See
# docs/security-runbook.md § 6 for the one-time cleanup commands the
# maintainer must run to *untrack* the already-committed copies (this file
# only prevents NEW additions; existing tracked files stay tracked until
# `git rm -r --cached` is run).

# JetBrains IDEs (IntelliJ, Android Studio) — leave only the few files that
# are intentionally shared (e.g. runConfigurations/, codeStyles/).
.idea/
!.idea/runConfigurations/
!.idea/codeStyles/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Cursor IDE
.cursor/
.cursorrules

# JetBrains AI Assistant
.aiassistant/

# Devin
.devin/

# Common editor swap files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
